{"id":"00271","root":"uni00271_1","name":{"ja":"磯咲　伊紀","en":"Isozaki Inori"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"磯咲　伊紀","en":"Isozaki Inori"},"element":"Natural","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2019-11-30","limited":false,"characterId":200,"profile":{"ja":"五車学園に通う学生。磯咲伊織の姉で、ふうまのクラスメイト。学生の身ながら、いくつもの任務をこなす優秀な生徒。任務の成功率は高いのだが、慈悲深い性格で、しばしば敵にも情けをかけてしまうことがある。中にはその慈悲深さに感動して、彼女のためなら対魔忍に協力してもいいという敵も現れるほどであり、アサギたちはそれも彼女の能力の一つであると考えて見守っている。クラスメイトであるふうまに恋心を抱いており、それが彼女にとっての初恋。しかし、そんな思いは胸の内に潜めて、影で彼を見守っている。","en":"Isozaki Inori is a student at Gosha Academy and the older sister of Isozaki Iori, as well as a classmate of Fuuma. Though still a student, she excels at completing numerous missions, boasting a high success rate. Her compassionate nature sometimes leads her to show mercy to enemies. Her kindness has even moved some foes to the point where they'd cooperate with the Taimanin on her behalf, and Asagi and the others consider this another facet of her ability. She harbors a crush on her classmate Fuuma, her first love, but keeps those feelings hidden, watching over him from the shadows."},"illustrator":"さくらんぼ","voiceActor":"かりんとうか","forms":[{"id":"uni00271_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1096,2192],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[128,256],"def":[112,224],"spd":[73,73],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["4","410007"]},{"id":"uni00271_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1692,3384],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[191,382],"def":[159,318],"spd":[73,73],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["4","410007","410008"]},{"id":"uni00271_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[2288,4575],"sp":[300,300],"atk":[259,520],"def":[211,422],"spd":[73,73],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["4","410007","410008"]}],"skills":{"4":{"slot":"attack","id":4,"name":null,"hits":2,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"leve